            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Pall of Shadow"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy, shadow)\n\nWhen a shadow giant hits with a melee Strike, the target must succeed at a 30 Fortitude save or become drained 1 and take a \u20131 status penalty to Perception checks involving sight as long as they remain drained. On a critical failure, this condition doesn't heal naturally and can be removed only with magic."
