            "action_name": {
              "value": "Shadowcloak"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, illusion, shadow)\n\nThe shadow giant becomes shrouded in shadows and becomes concealed. As the nature of this effect leaves the giant's location obvious, it can't use this concealment to Hide or Sneak. This effect lasts for 1 minute or until it is exposed to direct sunlight, whichever comes first."
            },
